 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the interval I(p, q) as a directed acyclic graph whose directed p-q paths \
are exactly the shortest paths from p to q: the graph of InfraSegment[p, q]"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"950b6d1c-34c3-47f9-a8db-2138ce4f0588"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
