  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "71399fd5-d75c-4964-b516-1915868cd041"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the breadth-first DAG rooted at c, whose source-to-sink paths are exactly \
the maximal shortest paths from c"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"25aef627-3b7c-439c-8425-56c3e2baf5ce"],

Cell["\<\
waits: ArcGraph, the band interval DAG of an arc, whose chains are its \
